  "notes": "The present peaks are independent kinematic X-ray calculations (0.8-20 A, sum multiplicity*|F|^2, maximum 100), not measured intensities or a recovered source-card selection. COD 9001848 Yang, Prewitt and Frost (1997), including reported occupancies, Mg1.11Si1.89H2.22O6 per cell. Rounded special thirds are snapped within 5e-6. No Fe site occupancy is invented: the EOS sample contains about 3.7 wt% Fe, so this is a structural surrogate.",
